KNOWNBUG libstdcxx16 libstdcxx
main.cpp
--cpp20 --object-bits 12
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ duration: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
dropped the body
--
With the libstdc++ 16.2.0 headers (g++ 16.2.0), including <chrono> drops
the body of `__get_leap_second_info' (chrono line 3230); the suppressed
diagnostics are "template '_S_test' not found", "template '__declval' not
found" and "template '_S_test_2' not found" in <type_traits> (lines 2622,
2653, 2720).  With the 16-20260315 snapshot that the CI gcc-16 job installs
the program converts.  The same program is
cpp11_libstdcxx_header_drops/test_chrono.desc.
